OL,3,AFrom weeks to hours - the rapid new
OL,4,Atest transforming brain tumour
OL,5,Adiagnosis
OL,6,
OL,7,FSteve Palmer, 55, from Nottingham, is
OL,8,Famong those to benefit from the new
OL,9,Ftechnology - and it meant surgeons were
OL,10,Fable to get his result while they were
OL,11,Fstill operating to remove his tumour.
OL,13,F"Getting that quick diagnosis removed
OL,14,Fweeks of anxiety," he told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
